Update...

Looks like I needed to set the mapred.job.tracker value to local in my
pseudo config file and restart the mapred daemon.

<configuration>
  <property>
    <name>mapred.job.tracker</name>
    <value>local</value>
    <!--<value>localhost:8021</value>-->
  </property>
</configuration>

-Matt

