You shouldn't have to change mapred.job.tracker in your config.

Usually

rhmr(..., mapred=list(mapred.job.tracker='local'))

will start a local run (assuming you have permissions)

On Mon, Jan 24, 2011 at 11:34 AM, mtanquary <matt.t...@gmail.com> wrote:
> Update...
